  unitName: Aquarius of Weeping (EU)
  unitId: 740176
  unitNumber: 7137
  description: "Sailing around the Bad Lands alone, glorying in the stars, Gazolina
    was enjoying her newfound freedom. The constellation of Aquarius was reflected
    on the waves when Gazolina\u2019s Techs became mired in a dark pool. Gazolina
    didn\u2019t think twice about diving in immediately to untangle the weeds that
    she thought were hindering her progress. She never came out of the dark liquid.
    The Corruption which was invading every dimension had found a new and powerful
    defender. The dark tears which had flowed down her cheeks were still wet as she
    contaminated more souls every day."
  summonDesc: I will defend the Corruption if that is to be my destiny.
  fusionDesc: My Techs feed off desolation
